  "title": "Sausage Egg Casserole",
  "description": "Assemble the ingredients the night before, and bake this casserole in the morning. Stand back and wait for the compliments. I&#39;ve made it with fat free cottage cheese, egg substitute, and reduced fat sausage; the taste is still wonderful!",
  "authors": [
